---
---

<section class="py-16 px-4 bg-white border-y border-gray-100">
  <div class="max-w-5xl mx-auto">
    <div class="text-center mb-12">
      <h2 class="text-3xl md:text-4xl font-extrabold text-brand-red mb-2">Como funciona?</h2>
      <p class="text-gray-600 font-medium max-w-2xl mx-auto">
        O método R4T foi desenhado para ser direto ao ponto. Você não vai perder tempo com teorias chatas, vamos direto para a graxa.
      </p>
    </div>

    {/* Bloco 1: O Método */}
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8 mb-16">
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 order-2 md:order-1">
        <div class="space-y-6">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-red font-bold text-xl">1</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Acesso Imediato ao Portal</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Assim que o pagamento for confirmado, você recebe no seu e-mail o acesso completo a todas as videoaulas na nossa plataforma fechada.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          
          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-red font-bold text-xl">2</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Assista de Qualquer Dispositivo</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Aulas em alta resolução gravadas direto da bancada. Assista pelo celular, tablet ou computador quantas vezes precisar.</p>
            </div>
          </div>

          <div class="flex items-start gap-4">
            <div class="flex-shrink-0 w-10 h-10 rounded-full bg-red-100 flex items-center justify-center text-brand-red font-bold text-xl">3</div>
            <div>
              <h3 class="text-xl font-bold text-gray-900 mb-1">Aplica e Acelera</h3>
              <p class="text-gray-600">Mostramos o passo a passo da montagem, as folgas exatas e o acerto final. É só copiar e colar na sua oficina ou garagem.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
      
      {/* Imagem Mockup (Notebook) */}
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2 order-1 md:order-2">
        <div class="relative bg-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-inner ring-1 ring-gray-200">
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow-xl overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center relative">
            <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjgiPgo8cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iOCIgaGVpZ2h0PSI4IiBmaWxsPSIjMDAwIiBmaWxsLW9wYWNpdHk9IjAuMSIvPgo8cGF0aCBkPSJNMCAwTDggOFpNOCAwTDAgOFoiIHN0cm9rZT0iI2ZmZiIgc3Ryb2tlLW9wYWNpdHk9IjAuMSIvPgo8L3N2Zz4=')]"></div>
            <p class="text-gray-400 font-medium z-10">Mockup Notebook / Celular</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>

    {/* Bloco 2: Pré-requisitos */}
    <div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row items-center gap-8">
      {/* Imagem Mockup (Peças) */}
      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
        <div class="relative bg-gray-100 rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-inner ring-1 ring-gray-200">
          <div class="aspect-[4/3] bg-gray-800 rounded-lg shadow-xl overflow-hidden flex items-center justify-center relative">
             <div class="absolute inset-0 opacity-20 bg-[url('data:image/svg+xml;base64,PHN2ZyB4bWxucz0iaHR0cDovL3d3dy53My5vcmcvMjAwMC9zdmciIHdpZHRoPSI4IiBoZWlnaHQ9IjgiPgo8cmVjdCB3aWR0aD0iOCIgaGVpZ2h0PSI4IiBmaWxsPSIjMDAwIiBmaWxsLW9wYWNpdHk9IjAuMSIvPgo8cGF0aCBkPSJNMCAwTDggOFpNOCAwTDAgOFoiIHN0cm9rZT0iI2ZmZiIgc3Ryb2tlLW9wYWNpdHk9IjAuMSIvPgo8L3N2Zz4=')]"></div>
             <p class="text-gray-400 font-medium z-10">Mockup Monitor / Peças</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="w-full md:w-1/2">
        <h2 class="text-3xl font-extrabold text-brand-red mb-4">Pré-Requisitos:</h2>
        <p class="text-gray-600 mb-6 font-medium">
          Você não precisa ser o mestre da mecânica para entender esse conteúdo. Explicamos tudo mastigado. Apenas precisa:
        </p>
        
        <ul class="space-y-3 mb-8">
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-red" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span class="text-gray-800 font-medium">Ferramentas básicas de oficina</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-red" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span class="text-gray-800 font-medium">Força de vontade para sujar a mão de graxa</span>
          </li>
          <li class="flex items-center gap-2">
            <svg class="w-5 h-5 text-brand-red" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M5 13l4 4L19 7"></path></svg>
            <span class="text-gray-800 font-medium">Vontade de deixar os amigos comendo poeira</span>
          </li>
        </ul>

        <a href="#oferta" class="inline-block py-3 px-8 bg-brand-red hover:bg-brand-red-dark text-white text-lg font-bold rounded-lg shadow-lg shadow-brand-red/30 transition-transform hover:scale-105">
          GARANTIR MEU ACESSO
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>

  </div>
</section>
